			6: DC Watchdog Error
			7: Driver Error
			8: DSP Error
			9: Devicetree Error
			10: Firmware Error
			11: Hardware Error
			12: Invalid ID Error
			13: Initialization Error
			14: IOCTL Error
			15: IRQ Error
			16: Power Management Error
			17: Reset Error
			18: Sysfs Error
			19: Temperature Error
			20: Write Sequencer Error

